// 本文件是会话令牌的搬运层：把浏览器 cookie 里的令牌提升为 Authorization 请求头，再交给框架的鉴权中间件校验。
// This file moves session tokens around: it promotes the token held in a browser cookie into the Authorization header
// and hands it to the framework's authentication middleware.

package middleware

import (
	"strings"

	"{{ .Module }}/internal/meta"
	"{{ .YdModule }}/router"
)

// SessionOptions configures Promote. | SessionOptions 配置 Promote。
type SessionOptions struct {
	// Cookie is the cookie carrying the token, internal/meta's TokenCookie by default. | Cookie 是承载令牌的 cookie 名，默认 internal/meta 的 TokenCookie。
	Cookie string
	// Header is the destination header, Authorization by default. | Header 是目标请求头，默认 Authorization。
	Header string
	// Prefix is the authentication scheme prefix, "Bearer " by default. | Prefix 是请求头的认证方案前缀，默认 "Bearer "。
	Prefix string
}

// withDefaults fills the empty fields with the documented defaults. | withDefaults 用约定取值填充空字段。
func (o SessionOptions) withDefaults() SessionOptions {
	if o.Cookie == "" {
		o.Cookie = meta.TokenCookie
	}
	if o.Header == "" {
		o.Header = meta.AuthHeader
	}
	if o.Prefix == "" {
		o.Prefix = meta.BearerPrefix
	}
	return o
}

// Promote 把 cookie 中的令牌写进 Authorization 请求头，请求头已有取值时原样不动。
// Promote copies the cookie token into the Authorization header and leaves an existing header untouched.
//
// 为什么要这一层：框架的 auth.Middleware 只认一个来源（DefaultTokenLookup 读 Authorization），
// 浏览器却拿不到 HttpOnly cookie 里的令牌去自己拼请求头。于是链路变成「cookie → 请求头 → 校验」，
// 浏览器与 API 客户端（直接带 Authorization）走的是同一条校验路径，令牌存储方式不影响鉴权逻辑。
// Why this layer exists: the framework's auth.Middleware reads exactly one source (DefaultTokenLookup reads
// Authorization) while a browser cannot read an HttpOnly cookie to build that header itself. The chain therefore
// becomes "cookie → header → verification": browsers and API clients (which send Authorization directly) share one
// verification path and the storage of the token never leaks into the auth logic.
//
// 请求头优先于 cookie：显式带了 Authorization 的调用方（例如自动化测试里拿着一枚只读令牌）不会被浏览器里的会话覆盖。
// The header wins over the cookie: a caller that sends Authorization explicitly (an automated test holding a read-only
// token, say) is never overridden by the browser session.
//
// CSRF 说明：令牌放在 SameSite=Lax 的 cookie 里，跨站表单 POST 不会携带它；需要更强的保证时给写操作加同源校验，
// 或让前端改用请求头（本中间件对两种方式一视同仁）。
// CSRF note: the token lives in a SameSite=Lax cookie, so a cross-site form POST never carries it; for a stronger
// guarantee add an origin check to the write endpoints or have the front end send the header instead (this middleware
// treats both identically).
func Promote(o SessionOptions) router.Middleware {
	o = o.withDefaults()
	return func(c *router.Ctx) {
		if strings.TrimSpace(c.Header(o.Header)) != "" {
			c.Next()
			return
		}
		token := strings.TrimSpace(c.Cookie(o.Cookie))
		if token == "" {
			c.Next()
			return
		}

		c.Request.Header.Set(o.Header, o.Prefix+token)
		c.Next()
	}
}
